WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.029
摄影师。
A photographer.

00:00:25.229 --> 00:00:27.557
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:30.069
Harland把订婚提前了，还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:30.269 --> 00:00:32.581
Luca，关掉车库监控。
Luca. Kill the garage cameras.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
你：什么叫我害的？你把话说清楚。
You: What do you mean, my doing? Explain yourself.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:45.161
“是你的气味。是它让我这样。”
Your scent. It did this.

00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:52.697
“Mate。这就是你对我的意义。”
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:55.209
（画外 Luca）“先生……您的眼睛。”
Sir… your eyes.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
你：Mate是什么意思？你先说清楚。
You: What does Mate mean? Explain first.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:00.237
只有一个。每头狼，一生只有一个。
One. Only one, for every wolf.

00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:05.277
跟我走。路上我告诉你。
Come with me. I'll explain.

00:01:07.989 --> 00:01:10.301
现在我身上全是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
你：把手覆上他的拳头
You: Lay your hand over his fist
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:20.369
别……
Don't.

00:01:25.593 --> 00:01:27.905
你好暖。
You're warm.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
你：Selene是谁？你接之前先告诉我。
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:37.973
Selene。和我订婚的那个人。
Selene. The one I'm engaged to.

00:01:40.685 --> 00:01:42.997
他们现在会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:43.197 --> 00:01:45.509
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
你：他们是谁？你说让他们来，凭什么？
You: Who are they? You said let them come. Why?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:53.049
我的族人。
My people.

00:01:55.777 --> 00:01:58.089
因为我是他们的 Alpha。
Because I'm their Alpha.

00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:03.113
这里是我的领地。
This is my territory.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
你：跟他走进起居室
You: Follow him into the living room
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:13.181
来。
Come.

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.880
Selene从来都不是我的。
Selene was never mine.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:23.229
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
你：门外是谁？你先说清楚，我再决定留不留。
You: Who's at the door? Tell me first, then I'll decide whether to stay.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:28.257
Selene，她到了。
Selene. She's here.

00:02:33.497 --> 00:02:35.809
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:36.009 --> 00:02:38.321
他今晚不见任何人。
He's not receiving anyone tonight.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
你：走到他面前，手贴上他的脸
You: Walk up to him and touch his face
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:45.861
你走过来了。
You came closer.

00:02:53.613 --> 00:02:55.925
那你告诉我，这是什么？
Then what is it?

00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:58.437
我以为你会走。
I thought you'd leave.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
你：我没走。但你得当着她的面，说你选谁。
You: I didn't leave. But say who you choose, in front of her.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:03.465
你留下了。很好。
You stayed. Good.

00:03:03.665 --> 00:03:05.993
那就让她亲耳听到。
Then she hears it.

00:03:06.193 --> 00:03:08.003
来。
Come.

00:03:08.203 --> 00:03:10.012
选吧，Magnus。她，还是我。
Choose, Magnus. Her or me.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
你：伸手握住他的手
You: Reach out and take his hand
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:21.069
你的手。
Your hand.

00:03:26.309 --> 00:03:28.621
我等这一刻等了太久。
I've waited so long for this.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
你：外面那是什么声音？是她叫来的人吗？
You: What's that sound outside? Did she send them?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:41.201
不是她的人。是我的族人。
Not her people. Mine.

00:03:41.401 --> 00:03:42.876
来，陪我坐一会儿。
Come. Sit with me.

00:03:49.774 --> 00:03:51.249
找了三十年。值得。
Thirty years. Worth it.

00:03:51.549 --> 00:03:53.849
你：拉着他走到窗边看外面
You: Pull him to the window to look outside
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 13 轮 · Realtime round 13）

00:03:53.949 --> 00:03:56.277
“你带路。”
Lead the way.

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:00.815
“看。他们在守着。”
Look. They're watching.

00:04:05.034 --> 00:04:06.843
“Alpha，Harland召集了长老，要您今晚就去。”
Alpha. Harland called the elders. Tonight.

00:04:09.153 --> 00:04:11.453
你：他们凭什么要你把我交出去？我跟你去，但你不许松手。
You: What right do they have to make you hand me over? I'll go with you, but don't let go.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 14 轮 · Realtime round 14）

00:04:11.553 --> 00:04:13.881
古老的族规，血脉的规矩，不是我的选择。
Old law. Blood law. Not my choice.

00:04:14.081 --> 00:04:16.409
我不会松手。
I won't let go.

00:04:22.638 --> 00:04:24.447
她是我的Mate。
She is my Mate.

00:04:24.647 --> 00:04:26.457
你就是向自己的血脉宣战。
Then you've declared war on your own blood.
你就是向自己的血脉宣战。
Then you've declared war on your own blood.

00:04:26.757 --> 00:04:29.057
你：握紧他的手，向前一步
You: Grip his hand and step forward
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 15 轮 · Realtime round 15）

00:04:29.157 --> 00:04:31.485
你向前走了一步。
You stepped forward.

00:04:34.213 --> 00:04:36.525
待在我身边。
Stay beside me.

00:04:39.237 --> 00:04:41.549
哈兰给了我们到满月为止。
Harland gave us until the moon.

00:04:44.361 --> 00:04:46.661
你：满月之后会怎样？你别瞒我，我要听实话。
You: What happens after the full moon? Don't hide it from me. I want the truth.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 16 轮 · Realtime round 16）

00:04:46.761 --> 00:04:49.089
我不会骗你。
I won't lie to you.

00:04:51.817 --> 00:04:54.129
满月之夜，长老会会带走你。
At full moon, the Council claims you.

00:04:59.353 --> 00:05:01.665
Magnus，上前来。
Magnus. Step forward.

00:05:01.965 --> 00:05:04.265
你：拉着他的手，一起上前
You: Hold his hand and step forward together
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 17 轮 · Realtime round 17）

00:05:04.365 --> 00:05:06.693
你拉了我。
You pulled me.

00:05:09.421 --> 00:05:11.733
那我们就一起面对他们。
Then we face them together.

00:05:16.957 --> 00:05:19.269
让他们开个价。
Let them name their price.

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:21.869
你：满月之前，你要怎么证明给他们看？
You: Before the full moon, how will you prove it to them?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 18 轮 · Realtime round 18）

00:05:21.969 --> 00:05:26.825
我会证明你是我的。
I'll prove you're mine.

00:05:27.025 --> 00:05:29.337
不在这儿。过来。
Not here. Come.
